  <item>
    <title>124. 有些邪就是要信，有些包就是要撞</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ca3ef1a56ca3e0c4d7b4b5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ca3ef1a56ca3e0c4d7b4b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Sep 2025 05:01:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>[酒言酒语]</span></strong><span>的第一百二十四杯酒。每个人也许都有那么一两件不信邪的事，有些可能真的在执着之后就做成了（本期节目基本没有这样的好事儿），而在很多情况下就是被撞的满头是包终于服气了。今天聊了聊这些最好信了的邪。</span></p><span></span><h2><span># Highlights</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">1:07</a> 不信邪养三盆也活不了的植物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">4:11</a> 邪门的法器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> 有人去世的房子vs.“凶宅“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 不服气但还是喝不了威士忌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a> 越努力越脏的木地板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1758">29:18</a> 我就不信我做不了这么多事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2003">33:23</a> 吃辣吃到失去色彩和声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">38:38</a> 不要试图扶起一个醉酒的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2594">43:14</a> 理财产品会平等的惩罚不信邪的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2749">45:49</a> 无醇啤酒竟然也有好喝的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#今天的酒</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>布兰达酒庄小绵羊干白 PECORIN — 香气不一般</span></p><span></span><h2><span>#BGM</span></h2><span></span><p><span>草东 — 勇敢的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>象乐队 — 孔雀</span></p><span></span><p><span>#封面图</span></p><span></span><p><span>from 虎咪humica #异种族世界生存日志</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/60977f2fab52df57f9d06cf0/lqVrLBqJq5DKOyUbOoFq--KgK-6c.m4a" length="91639177" type="audio/mp4"/>
