  <item>
    <title>119. 世界とてもbig，ich会三门语言啥也不怕</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68412833219d35546fe2ced3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68412833219d35546fe2ced3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Jun 2025 05:29:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>[酒言酒语]</span></strong><span>的第一百一十九杯酒。好久好久不见了，我们想死你们了</span></p><span></span><h2><span>#引言</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大家好，上次节目还是冬天这次已经是初夏，失踪主播们找到路回来了。德国方面，槭槭发愤图强备战考试。大理方面，刀刀普通的活着。这期录的很开心，学习使人快乐 (?)</span></p><span></span><h2><span>#Highlights</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">2:15</a> 槭槭在失踪期间完成的两件大事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">8:11</a> 带你走进 Leben inDeutschland（在德国生活）考试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> TELC B1的苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">32:21</a> 刀刀的日语吹嘘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 不同语言的配套人格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 英语口音就像馕上的花一样多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2689">44:49</a> 更正一下，日语考试没有口语考试，刀刀大概只是擅长读写。。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 一门语言的学习资料足够多，很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3011">50:11</a> 日语作为一门“淡语”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3595">59:55</a> 特别委婉的日语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3725">1:02:05</a> 语言学杂了嘴就不听使唤</span></p><span></span><h2><span>#BGM</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大岛满 - Patema Inverse （歌词是世界语 电影本身也很好看）</span></p><span></span><p><span>周云鹏 - 大理九月live 安魂曲（老周的导盲犬熊熊去世了，他说用唱歌来纪念。希望大家的小动物家人们都健康快乐）</span></p><span></span><h2><span>#今天的酒</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大九酿造无序酸浑浊IPA - 特别清爽的柑橘柠檬芒果 好配这个季节</span></p><span></span><p><span>房东太太的接骨木糖浆 - 可以增强免疫力喔</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.jiuhuar.com/craftbeer/5f3c9d2f526c6007b38dc792.html" data-url="https://www.jiuhuar.com/craftbeer/5f3c9d2f526c6007b38dc792.html"><br><span>&nbsp;</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/60977f2fab52df57f9d06cf0/lqfhAkOW306ih8wZkOg-D5eXneCn.m4a" length="114449177" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiDUcmfMssicS8ozpEkQjynDP7nk.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>119</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
